# Generated files
#
# Anchored: `make lib` emits this header from cmd/objstorelib via
# -buildmode=c-shared and moves it here (Makefile), and `make clean` removes it.
# A bare `libobjstore.h` would match the name at any depth below this directory.
/libobjstore.h

# The compiled test client and example, built by this directory's Makefile and
# removed by its `clean` target. Anchored for the same reason as the header.
# Without these, running the suite leaves multi-megabyte executables sitting
# untracked next to their sources, one `git add .` away from the history.
/test_objstore
/simple_example
